@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 1080p 单帧数据与内存流 / Per-frame Data Flow

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #64748B
skinparam rectangleFontColor #0F172A
skinparam noteBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

top to bottom direction

rectangle "MediaCodec / Media3 GL texture\nSDR frame + source PTS" as Decode #E0F2FE
rectangle "CPU RGBA8 readback\n640 x 360 x 4 bytes\n921,600 B = 0.879 MiB" as Readback #F1F5F9
rectangle "CPU preprocess array\nfloat32 NCHW [1,3,360,640]\n691,200 values = 2.637 MiB" as Nchw #FCE7F3
rectangle "Pinned ORT input FloatBuffer\nfloat32 NCHW [1,3,360,640]\n2.637 MiB copied per run" as OrtInput #FEF3C7
rectangle "QuickSRNetSmall 3x\nONNX Runtime QNN EP -> HTP\nRGB only; alpha bypasses the model" as Qnn #EDE9FE
rectangle "Two pinned ORT output slots\nfloat32 NHWC [1,1080,1920,3]\n6,220,800 values = 23.730 MiB each" as OrtOutput #FEF3C7
rectangle "Deferred bulk copy on postprocess lane\nNHWC float array, then four fixed row stripes" as CopyPack #ECFDF5
rectangle "CPU packed output\nRGBA8 1920 x 1080 x 4 bytes\n8,294,400 B = 7.910 MiB" as RgbaOutput #ECFDF5
rectangle "Direct upload to Media3 output texture\n1920 x 1080; original PTS preserved" as Upload #E0F2FE
rectangle "SurfaceFlinger\nactual-present cadence proxy" as Surface #F1F5F9

Decode --> Readback : GPU / GL -> CPU
Readback --> Nchw : normalize RGB to [0,1]\nreorder RGBA -> NCHW
Nchw --> OrtInput : float[] -> direct FloatBuffer
OrtInput --> Qnn : Session.run
Qnn --> OrtOutput : HTP -> pinned output buffer
OrtOutput --> CopyPack : transfer output-slot lease
Readback ..> CopyPack : nearest-neighbor alpha side channel
CopyPack --> RgbaOutput : clamp + quantize RGB\nrestore alpha
RgbaOutput --> Upload : CPU -> GL
Upload --> Surface : Media3 / BufferQueue

note right of OrtOutput
  双 slot 比单 slot额外增加 23.730 MiB，
  目的是让 N+1 推理与 N 后处理重叠。
end note

note right of Upload
  这就是当前的 GL -> CPU -> QNN -> CPU -> GL 往返。
  它已经减少了冗余 blit，但尚未成为 shared-buffer zero-copy。
end note
@enduml
